{"metadata":{"categoryPathComponent":"Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)","title":"Swift Package integration","category":"Orange Unified Design System","role":"project"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-1-package-and-libraries","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[{"image":"ic_unified_ds.png","estimatedTimeInMinutes":10,"xcodeRequirement":"Xcode 27.1","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS iOS is exposed through an open source Swift Package hosted on GitHub, and provides several libraries for your needs."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"These libraries help to split products and make users able to select only what they need."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"SwiftUI is the only official supported framework for Apple platforms."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"projectFiles":"OUDS-Discovery-Tutorial.zip","title":"Swift Package integration","kind":"hero","backgroundImage":"ic_unified_ds.png","chapter":"Import of the Swift Package and choose its libraries"},{"tasks":[{"contentSection":[{"mediaPosition":"trailing","kind":"contentAndMedia","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS for iOS is an open source Swift Package available on GitHub under MIT license."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The package and the libraries must be added through Xcode."}]}]}],"stepsSection":[{"media":"tutorial-discovery-1-ouds-swift-package.png","code":null,"caption":[],"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Using Xcode, in your "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"project package dependencies","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":", add a new "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"dependency"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Search with the GitHub repository URL (https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios), and select the "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"ouds-ios"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" dependency."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"You can then choose the "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"dependency rule","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" you want."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"To know which version you need, you can have a look on the "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios\/wiki\/01-%E2%80%90-Available-API","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and also the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios\/releases","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Let’s say you will use some beta version today, e.g. the version 3.0.0-beta.8"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"runtimePreview":null,"type":"step"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Once you downloaded the package, you will see several libraries are available."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"They can be embedded inside your "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"target"}]},{"type":"text","text":" libraries."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Things are separated to let users integrate only what they need and embed the bare minimum of content.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDSThemesContract"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" library provides the main elements like the ","type":"text"},{"code":"OUDSThemeableView","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". The theme contract is defined inside it.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDSThemesOrange","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" provides the theme implementation for the Orange products, and contains also assets and all tokens for this theme.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDSThemesSosh"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" provides the theme implementation for the Sosh products, and contains also assets and all tokens for this theme.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDSThemesWireframe"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" provides the theme implementation for the Wireframe theme, which is a theme dedicated to mockups and prototypes.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDSThemesOrangeCompact"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" provides the theme implementation for the Orange products but with constraints of sizes and spaces.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDSComponents","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" contains the SwiftUI OUDS components defined with the Figma specifications, and also useful view modifers."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDSTokensRaw"}]},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDSTokensSemantic"}]},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDSTokensComponents"}]},{"text":" are libraries defining and providing the tokens for low level (raw),","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"middle level (semantic) or component levels (high level)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDSModules","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" is for modules or rich components with extra logic."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDSFoundations"}]},{"type":"text","text":" is dedicated to some utilities and shared logic."}]}],"caption":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Add for example only the umbrella product merging all products mentioned above: "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDSSwiftUI"}]}]}],"media":"tutorial-discovery-1-ouds-libraries.png","type":"step","code":null,"runtimePreview":null}],"anchor":"Import-the-Swift-Package-and-the-libraries","title":"Import the Swift Package and the libraries"}],"kind":"tasks"},{"assessments":[{"content":[],"type":"multiple-choice","choices":[{"isCorrect":true,"justification":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS is open source, under MIT license, and hosted on GitHub. Of course you can contribute!"}]}],"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"I can contribute to OUDS using pull request"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDS supports officialy all Apple OS like visionOS, tvOS, watchOS, iPadOS, iOS and also CarPlay.","type":"text"}]}],"isCorrect":false,"justification":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The main supported targets are iOS \/ iPadOS. However we do our best to support macOS, visionOS, tvOS and watchOS.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"CarPlay specific cases are not scoped yet.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS provides UIKit components"}]}],"justification":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDS supports only SwiftUI.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"isCorrect":false}],"title":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Which of these choices is correct?"}]}]},{"title":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Which imports of the OUDS Swift Package products can I choose?"}]}],"content":[],"choices":[{"justification":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You can import all products provided by the Swift Package, and tailor your choice to keep only the ones needed."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Even if we recommend 